    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_RevertDialogTitle">Revert to Defaults?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_RevertDialogContent">EvolveOS Optimizer uses Windows System Restore to safely revert all changes made to your system.&#x0a;&#x0a;Clicking 'Continue' will open the Windows System Restore wizard. Please select the restore point named 'EvolveOS Initial Backup' to undo all tweaks.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_RevertMissingTitle">Restore Point Missing</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_RevertMissingContent">The 'EvolveOS Optimizer Initial Backup' restore point could not be found. You may have opted out of creating it, or Windows automatically deleted it to free up disk space.&#x0a;&#x0a;You can still continue to open the System Restore wizard to look for older, manual restore points.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_ShowRestorePointOnStart">Prompt to create a restore point on startup</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_ShowRestorePointOnStartDesc">Shows a prompt to create a system restore point every time you launch the application.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Settings_RestoreTweaksTitle">Restore Optimizer Tweaks</sys:String>
